    "Switches the desk between your sitting and standing heights.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "座り姿勢と立ち姿勢の高さを切り替えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在坐姿和站姿高度之间切换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在坐姿和站姿高度之間切換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app reconnects automatically. With more than one desk, it connects to whichever is in range.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動的に再接続します。デスクが複数ある場合は、近くにあるデスクに接続します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 会自动重新连接。如果有多张桌子，会连接在附近的那一张。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 會自動重新連線。如果有多張桌子，會連線在附近的那一張。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The desk isn't connected. Make sure it's powered and nearby.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デスクが接続されていません。電源が入っていて近くにあるか確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌子未连接。请确认桌子已通电且在附近。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌子未連線。請確認桌子已通電且在附近。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The desk's own control panel has no memory buttons, so presets live in this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デスクのコントロールパネルにはメモリーボタンがないため、プリセットはこのアプリに保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌子自带的控制器没有记忆按键，所以预设保存在这个 App 里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌子內建的控制器沒有記憶按鍵，所以預設儲存在這個 App 裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time, macOS may ask you to pair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初回は macOS からペアリングを求められることがあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次连接时，macOS 可能会要求配对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次連線時，macOS 可能會要求配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac can't talk to the desk.": {
